const mapDoc=`# Current map / option / outcome synchronization audit\n\nRead-only. No route, UI, formula, status or model source was changed. ${ref(`${root}ScenarioFiveMap.tsx`,"const POINTS")} and ${ref(`${ui}presentation.ts`,"buildScenario5PlayerView")} are the current references.\n\n## Route geometry\n\n${table(convoyRows,["convoyId","corridorId","route","mapFrom","mapTo"])}\nAlpha and delta share Tehran (428,200) as origin. Beta ends at Tehran; gamma ends at Tehran. The image is a geographic backdrop, not a navigational route solver. Reroute actions never generate alternative geometry.\n\n## Exact visual position\n\n\`\`\`ts\ndesired = status === "delivered" ? 1 : clamp(worldClockMinutes / Math.max(projectedArrivalMinute, 1), 0, .97);\nvisual = status === "delivered" ? 1 : status === "held" ? previousVisual : Math.max(previousVisual, desired);\noriginSeparationWeight = clamp(1 - progress / 0.08, 0, 1);\nroutePoint = from + (to-from) * progress;\ndisplayPoint = routePoint + originOffset * originSeparationWeight;\n// alpha offset=(0,-12), delta=(0,+12); beta/gamma=(0,0)\n\`\`\`\n\nState persists per run via refs. Backtracking is prevented even if ETA increases. Held freezes at previous visual position; delivered jumps to 1. CSS transform transition is 850ms cubic-bezier(.22,.75,.2,1). Origin separation vanishes at progress .08. Visual marker position is NOT a simulated traveled-distance state and never enters mission/telemetry/scoring. All 128 traces had zero exposed held states because mission status recomputation resets the transient hold flag.\n\n## Status styling\n\n- moving: dashed route flow, cyan truck.\n- held: route animation disabled, gray truck and Ⅱ marker; supported but not observed at any exposed snapshot.\n- compromised: orange truck/ring and pulsing warning; source condition integrity<55.\n- delivered: route animation disabled, completion ring/check; progress1.\n- fallbackNav→NAV; routeHardened→H; groundSupport→G; escortedNow→E. Temporary protection affects physics but has no separate map badge. escort badge uses post-commit currentRound equality. Convoy signature changes produce a 1500ms visual pulse; evidence itself has no newly-arrived pulse.\n\n## Evidence and action highlights\n\nPer route count = visibleEvidence.filter(e => e.observedCorridorId===corridorId).length; positive counts render «شاهد N». Null observed location contributes to «شواهد چندمحوره: N» in map header; current generator never emits null. Badge placed at midpoint, y-25 SVG units. Opened evidence highlight uses the FIRST visible evidence whose ID is in expandedEvidenceIds, not necessarily the most recently opened one. Priority: selectedTarget → fixed-alpha action → first expanded evidence observed corridor. target='none' sets globalRoutePulse while that action is selected. No threat probability or true-corridor graphic exists. Confirm clears selectedTarget/evidence view; reason pane retains text context but map no longer highlights pending target.\n\n## Data classification\n\n${table([{element:"base image/route coordinates/deconfliction/transitions",classification:"presentation only",source:"ScenarioFiveMap.tsx / ScenarioFive.css"},{element:"status/integrity/delay/deadline/mitigations/current clock",classification:"player-visible runtime values",source:"safe buildScenario5PlayerView"},{element:"ETA=baseline+delay and clock/ETA progress",classification:"derived presentation of visible values",source:"presentation.ts / map"},{element:"evidence count/highlight",classification:"derived from visible observed locations or explicit player choice",source:"safe evidence summaries / local UI selection"},{element:"world/profile/primary/Actor pressure/provenance",classification:"hidden mission truth; absent from live map props",source:"only audit/AAR may read"}])}\n\n## Four under-map cards\n\n${table([{field:"convoy label/status",source:"safe convoyId/corridorId/status + Persian mapping",timing:"current mission state after commit",match:"same status used in marker classes"},{field:"integrity",source:"convoy.integrity",timing:"current, raw integer",match:"no render rounding; C/E invariants PASS"},{field:"delay",source:"convoy.delayMinutes",timing:"current, raw minute count",match:"same delay in outcome after-state and map ETA"},{field:"ETA",source:"baselineArrivalMinute + delayMinutes",timing:"current absolute T+ estimate",match:"same projectedArrivalMinute used by marker denominator/outcome"},{field:"D",source:"convoy.deadlineMinute",timing:"baseline deadline remains fixed",match:"same T+ clock convention as ETA"},{field:"mitigation badges",source:"fallbackNav/routeHardened/groundSupport/escortedNow",timing:"post-commit currentRound",match:"R7 escort outcome describes the action-step activation while E badge is already expired in round8"}])}\n\n## Every action synchronization matrix\n\n${table(syncMatrix)}\n\n## Executed checks and objective differences\n\nA..Q check results are in current-sync-results.json; DOM checks in current-flow-screenshots/manifest.json. Source-bound under-map numeric equality checks pass across 128 runs; no stale convoy number was found. Map progress follows the persistent presentation formula, not literal distance/time recovery. Objective differences M01/M02/M03 and N02/N03 are recorded in the issue register; they were NOT repaired.\n`;
write("scenario5-map-sync-audit.md",mapDoc);

